<section footer="1" header="0" xid="2" props="page-margin-right:0.7902in; page-width:8.5in; page-margin-header:0.7902in; page-margin-left:0.7902in; page-margin-footer:0.7902in; page-margin-bottom:3.785108cm; page-orientation:portrait; page-margin-top:3.785108cm; page-height:11in">
<p style="Heading 1" xid="3">Field notes</p>
<p style="Standard" xid="4">The survey covered <c props="font-weight:bold">three regions</c> over <c props="font-style:italic">six weeks</c>.<field footnote-id="0" text:note-citation="1" type="footnote_ref" xid="5" props="text-position:superscript"></field><foot footnote-id="0" xid="6">
<p style="Footnote" xid="7"><field type="footnote_anchor" footnote-id="0" xid="8"></field>	Counted from the first visit.</p>
</foot> Details are on the <a xlink:href="https://example.com/survey" xid="9">project page</a>.</p>
<p style="Standard" xid="11">The <ann xml:id="anno0" annotation="0" name="c1" xid="12"><annotate annotation-id="0" props="annotation-author:Mina Park; annotation-date:09-20-2026">
<p style="Normal" xid="13">Check against the raw counts.</p>
</annotate>totals</ann> below are <c props="bgcolor:#ffff00; shading-foreground-color:#ffff00; shading-pattern:1">provisional</c>.</p>
<p style="Heading 2" xid="15">Steps</p>
<p level="3" listid="1012" parentid="1011" style="" xid="16" props="margin-top:0in; list-style:Numbered List; margin-bottom:0.1in; text-indent:-0.700024cm; field-font:NULL; margin-left:2.731008cm"><field type="list_label" xid="17"></field>	Plan the route</p>
<p level="3" listid="1012" parentid="1011" style="" xid="18" props="margin-top:0in; list-style:Numbered List; margin-bottom:0.1in; text-indent:-0.700024cm; field-font:NULL; margin-left:2.731008cm"><field type="list_label" xid="19"></field>	Visit each site</p>
<p level="4" listid="1013" parentid="1012" style="" xid="20" props="margin-top:0in; list-style:Numbered List; margin-bottom:0.1in; text-indent:-0.700024cm; field-font:NULL; margin-left:3.431032cm"><field type="list_label" xid="21"></field>	Morning count</p>
<p level="4" listid="1013" parentid="1012" style="" xid="22" props="margin-top:0in; list-style:Numbered List; margin-bottom:0.1in; text-indent:-0.700024cm; field-font:NULL; margin-left:3.431032cm"><field type="list_label" xid="23"></field>	Evening count</p>
<p level="3" listid="1012" parentid="1011" style="" xid="24" props="margin-top:0in; list-style:Numbered List; margin-bottom:0.1in; text-indent:-0.700024cm; field-font:NULL; margin-left:2.731008cm"><field type="list_label" xid="25"></field>	Write the report</p>
<p level="3" listid="1012" parentid="1011" style="" xid="26" props="margin-top:0in; list-style:Numbered List; margin-bottom:0.1in; text-indent:-0.700024cm; field-font:NULL; margin-left:2.731008cm"><field type="list_label" xid="27"></field>	Bring water</p>
<p level="3" listid="1012" parentid="1011" style="" xid="28" props="margin-top:0in; list-style:Numbered List; margin-bottom:0.1in; text-indent:-0.700024cm; field-font:NULL; margin-left:2.731008cm"><field type="list_label" xid="29"></field>	Charge the camera</p>
